{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL1RoZSUyMFJlYXBpbmclMjAlMjgyMDA3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"The Reaping","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o8Vl4Vxp5LBth9J6Aa3k6PAefxt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4eakTJuJD3sRGfv1qVWW46iPq82.jpg","description":"Katherine Morrissey, a former Christian missionary, lost her faith after the tragic deaths of her family. Now she applies her expertise to debunking religious phenomena. When a series of biblical plagues overrun a small town, Katherine arrives to prove that a supernatural force is not behind the occurrences, but soon finds that science cannot explain what is happening. Instead, she must regain her faith to combat the evil that waits in a Louisiana swamp.\n\nRated R · Released 4 Apr 2007 · United States of America · Language: English · 99 min\nStudio: Dark Castle Entertainment, Chime Films, Eyetronics\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["Horror","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"99 min","cast":["Hilary Swank","David Morrissey","Idris Elba","AnnaSophia Robb","Stephen Rea","William Ragsdale","John McConnell","David Jensen"],"director":["Stephen Hopkins"],"released":"2007-04-04T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Thousands of years ago, there was a series of bizarre occurrences that many believe to have been the Ten Biblical Plagues. No one thought they could happen again. Until now.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Stephen Hopkins","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vaPQMexdI3I33kVWAK3i3OrDxF.jpg"},{"name":"Hilary Swank","character":"Katherine","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uin6aAehUGpPCiJCaSjZG8B7M7d.jpg"},{"name":"David Morrissey","character":"Doug","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gj7ENB9pBobXA3wMfw6uKcWr2GM.jpg"},{"name":"Idris Elba","character":"Ben","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/be1bVF7qGX91a6c5WeRPs5pKXln.jpg"},{"name":"AnnaSophia Robb","charac